{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はポートメッセ名古屋にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会でしたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん本当にありがとうございます(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に名古屋会場が1番一言で言うと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンがさみしい感じなんです(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも来てくれる人がいるから寂しくないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16枚目はもっと寂しくない様になります様に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお洋服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのに足だしたぞっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなにおいくら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってめちゃ聞かれたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョーカーは1000円"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス3000円"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート4000円と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれそんな感じ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色の使い方でなんかいい服着てる様に見せるのがマイブームですえへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛もお団子風にメイクさんにやってもらったよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪が伸びるとアレンジが広がるねヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前だけどっ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母親と子供感www"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応私が年上なんだけどなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん色気ありすぎなんだよちきしょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分けてくれやっ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまといい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりちゃんといい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故乃木坂は年下メンバーが色気ある子多いの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで生駒ちゃんには無いの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人化計画しても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色気はなかなか出ない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後の課題っすね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも怒涛の一週間が始まる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい加減アニメみたいっすよほんと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かろうじて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨシヒコと\n吉祥寺だけが住みたい街ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は観ている、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一話完結系はありがたい(´；ω；｀)⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーやばいよほんと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AGFも何にも行けなかったし、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中村明日美子先生の同級生展。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うっ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたかたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたかたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/06/3732935/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたかたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/b